OL,3,GNEWSANI Secretary Sir Chris Bryant to
OL,4,Avisit Dublin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe newly appointed secretary of state,
OL,7,FSir Chris Bryant, will be visiting the
OL,8,FRepublic of Ireland on Monday for the
OL,9,Ffirst time since taking office.
OL,11,FSir Chris will be in Dublin for a
OL,12,Fseries of engagements, meeting with
OL,13,Fgovernment ministers as well as UK and
OL,14,FIrish business representatives.
OL,16,FSpeaking ahead of his engagements, Sir
OL,17,FChris said he was committed to working
OL,18,Fwith ministers to uphold the Good
OL,19,FFriday Agreement and to "deliver on the
OL,20,Fcommitments on legacy that both
OL,21,Fgovernments have made".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
